dt=Text
<node>
name:Bill Hadley
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Bill listens carefully before acting.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
startat:bill_office
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
syn:bill,hadley,bill hadley
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
verb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
talk
4
ifobjin:bill,$available
	if:danger
		msg:You tell Bill about Cap, the still and the threatened attack. Bill rises at once. "Get help? We're going now!"
		msg:You and Bill race back to the nursery. Bill circles round to intercept Mr Bulb while you rejoin your friends in the potting room.
		set:help_called
		unset:jerry_away
		set:withfriends
		put:bill,potting_room
		unset:jerry_alone
		waitkey
		goto:potting_room_finale
	else
		if:note_read
			msg:Bill listens, but a missed appointment is not proof of a crime. "Find out where Cap went, and tell me if he is in trouble."
		else
			msg:Bill greets the gang. "Off to help Cap today?"
		endif
	endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
cap
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:Cap Tinkertop
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Cap Tinkertop, the gang's old friend.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
startat:$nowhere
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
syn:cap,captain,tinkertop
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
verb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
x
4
ifobjin:cap,$available
	if:cap_free
		msg:Cap is shaken but can walk with help.
	else
		msg:Cap's wrists are tied behind him. He is alive and urgently needs freeing.
	endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
talk
4
ifobjin:cap,$available
	if:cap_free
		msg:"Mrs Bulb has gone for her husband," Cap says. "He means to silence me. Get Bill, and keep that door shut!"
	else
		msg:Cap can only make a muffled sound. The ropes must come off first.
	endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
untie
4
ifobjin:cap,$available
	if:cap_free
		msg:Cap is already free.
	else
		set:cap_free
		set:danger
		put:cap,potting_room
		msg:Red loosens the knots while Peg steadies Cap. "An illicit still!" Cap gasps. "I found it while fixing the irrigation. Mrs Bulb has gone for her husband. He will kill me if he gets in."
		msg:Scoop leads Cap into the potting room. "Jerry must fetch Bill. The rest of us will brace the door."
		waitkey
		goto:potting_room
	endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
mrsbulb
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:Mrs Bulb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Mrs Bulb guards the entrance to her nursery.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
startat:nursery_front
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
syn:mrsbulb,mrs bulb,miss bulb,mrs
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
verb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
talk
4
ifobjin:mrsbulb,$available
	if:tracks_seen
		set:bulb_denied
		msg:Scoop asks about the wooden-leg marks. Mrs Bulb stiffens. "Old marks. He has not been here today. Now leave my yard."
	else
		msg:Scoop asks for Cap. "I asked him to mend the irrigation," says Mrs Bulb, "but he never arrived."
		ifnot:bulb_denied
			set:bulb_denied
			msg:As Mrs Bulb turns away, you notice several footprints in the soft earth beside the entrance.
			msg:Among the boot marks, you notice a series of small, round impressions.
	endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
peg
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:Peg
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
startat:red_barn
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Peg is the biggest and strongest of your friends. His broad shoulders and steady good humour make him a reassuring companion. He would rather lend a hand than make a speech.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
syn:peg
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
verb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
talk
4
ifobjin:peg,$available
	ifisroom:red_barn
	else
		ifisroom:riverside_path
			if:nest_seen
				msg:"There are too many of them for a quiet scuffle," Peg whispers. "We need a better idea."
			else
				msg:Peg keeps his voice low. "Look at the bushes before we go any closer."
			endif
		else
			msg:Peg stays close to you, watching for anything that might help.
		endif
	endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
red
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:Red
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
startat:red_barn
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Red's red hair is usually easier to spot than his latest invention. He notices loose screws, hidden catches and things that might be made useful. The broken tomato launcher was one of his recent projects.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
syn:red
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
verb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
talk
4
ifobjin:red,$available
	ifisroom:red_barn
	else
		ifisroom:riverside_path
			if:nest_seen
				msg:"The launcher is broken, but its rubber band is still good," Red whispers. "With a stone, it could bring that nest down."
			else
				msg:Red keeps his voice low. "Look at the bushes before we go any closer."
			endif
		else
			msg:Red stays close to you, watching for anything that might help.
		endif
	endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
scoop
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:Scoop
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
startat:red_barn
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Scoop has a quick tongue and a head full of plans. He likes to ask the questions and put the clues together, although his confidence sometimes gets the whole gang into trouble.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
syn:scoop
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
verb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
talk
4
ifobjin:scoop,$available
	ifisroom:red_barn
	else
		ifisroom:riverside_path
			if:nest_seen
				msg:"They are watching the path, not the branches above them," Scoop whispers.
			else
				msg:Scoop keeps his voice low. "Look at the bushes before we go any closer."
			endif
		else
			msg:Scoop stays close to you, watching for anything that might help.
		endif
	endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
striekers
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:the Strieker boys
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
The Strieker boys are the gang's persistent rivals, always ready with a taunt or an ambush.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
startat:riverside_path
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
syn:striekers,strieker,strieker boys,strikers,striker,strickers,boys
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
verb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
talk
4
ifisroom:riverside_path
	if:ambush_cleared
		msg:The Striekers have gone.
	else
		msg:You keep quiet. Calling out would give the gang away before you even have a plan.
	endif
else
	ifobjin:striekers,$available
		msg:Scoop asks them to lower their voices. They only laugh. Peg plants himself between them and the hiding place.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
push
4
ifisroom:riverside_path
	if:ambush_cleared
		msg:The Striekers have gone.
	else
		msg:You can't get close without walking straight into the ambush. You should examine the bushes.
	endif
else
	ifobjin:striekers,$available
		put:striekers,$nowhere
		set:truck_seen
		put:truck,hedge_watch
		msg:Peg shoulders a heavy basket into the gap and advances on the Striekers. They back away, then turn and run. You all crouch behind the baskets again.
		msg:A little later, you hear an engine. A truck rolls slowly into the loading yard and stops beside the nursery door. The driver climbs out of the cab and knocks.
		msg:The door opens a crack. The man exchanges a few words with someone inside, then switches off the engine.
		msg:Scoop touches your arm. "Wait. Let's see what they've come to collect."

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
x
4
ifobjin:striekers,$available
	ifisroom:riverside_path
		msg:The Striekers are crouching in the bushes ahead, watching the path. Your friends keep out of sight. A direct approach would take you straight into their ambush.
	else
		msg:The Striekers block the gap between the baskets and deliberately raise their voices. If they keep this up, someone from the nursery will come to investigate.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
