name:some loose boards
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Short boards stout enough to brace furniture against a door.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
startat:potting_room
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
