dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
A strong rubber band from Red's broken tomato launcher. Stretched between your fingers, it could send a small stone flying.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
verb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
take
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
move
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
untie
4
ifobjin:elastic,$inventory
	msg:You already have the rubber band.
else
	ifisroom:red_barn_yard
		if:elastic_removed
			msg:You've already removed the rubber band.
		else
			if:nest_seen
				set:elastic_removed
				put:elastic,$inventory
				msg:You unhook the rubber band from the broken frame. Red stretches it carefully. "With a stone, that'll do for our target."
			else
				msg:You leave the band attached. There's no reason to dismantle Red's invention yet.
			endif
		endif
	else
		msg:The rubber band is back at the broken launcher in the farm courtyard.
	endif
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
use
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
shoot
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
throw
4
ifobjin:$this,$available
	ifisroom:riverside_path
		if:ambush_cleared
			msg:The Striekers have gone. You leave the wasps alone.
		else
			if:nest_seen
				ifobjin:elastic,$inventory
					ifobjin:stone,$inventory
						set:ambush_cleared
						put:stone,$nowhere
						put:striekers,$nowhere
						msg:You stretch the rubber band, fit the stone and aim at the branch above the Striekers. The shot clips the nest loose. It drops into the bushes; a furious buzzing sends the boys running across the fields.
						msg:You and your friends keep well clear of the wasps and hurry along the stream to the town lane. Mrs Smith and her friends have gone too; both routes to Cap's house are clear now.
						waitkey
						goto:town_lane
					else
						msg:You have the rubber band, but you need a small stone. Smooth stones lie along the stream bank.
					endif
				else
					msg:A hand-thrown stone would be too uncertain. Red remembers the sound rubber band on the broken tomato launcher in the farm courtyard.
				endif
			else
				msg:You need a safe target. You should examine the bushes and branches before trying anything.
			endif
		endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
drop
4
ifobjin:$this,$available
	msg:You keep the useful rubber band in your pocket.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
