dt=Text
<node>
name:Jerry Todd and the Killer Bulbs
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:This adventure was conceived by #Gianluca #Gemelli and adapted by #Marco #Giorgini. It is set in the literary world of #Jerry #Todd, created in the 1920s by #Leo #Edwards.
msg:You play #Jerry, a boy growing up in rural America in the early twentieth century. Along with his friends, he has a remarkable talent for getting into trouble.
setvar:pressure,0
set:withfriends
waitkey
goto:red_barn

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
image:png/title_en.png
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
_end
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:The Bulbs exposed
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:Bill reaches the nursery before the barricade breaks. Mr Bulb and his men are stopped; Cap is safe.
msg:The still and the buried money explain the Bulbs' business. All it took to ruin them was an old grumbler and a leaking irrigation pipe.
msg:"Killer bulbs!" Red exclaims, looking at the bulb crates.
msg:"Almost," says Cap. "Next time, boys, if I find a suspicious pipe, I'll leave it alone."
msg:You grin. Scoop already has the story worked out, but Peg is hungry and Red insists you've all earned an ice cream.
msg:Bill gives you all a stern look, then smiles and nods. The gang has earned a quiet afternoon.
msg:THE END
waitkey
quit

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
image:png/_end.png
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
