<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:The barricade fails
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:The unbraced door bursts open before help can reach Cap. The gang's rescue has failed.
msg:Try again? (Y/N)
getkey
ifkey:Y
	start
else
	quit
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
