dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:On a sweltering morning, you're chatting with Peg, Red and Scoop in Red's barn.
msg:"In this heat, we could do with an ice cream," Scoop says at last. But, as usual, nobody has a penny.
waitkey
clear
msg:$roomdesc
ifdef:$room.exits	
	msg:There are clear exits to +
	msg:$room.exits
	msg:.
endif
ifobjinattr:$any,$here,visible+listable
	msg:You see: +
	listobjin:$here,visible+listable

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
