dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Cap's little porch has the comfortable untidiness of a place much used by its owner. A wooden chair stands beside the front door, and a clay flowerpot rests on the railing. This morning, everything is unusually quiet.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
