<node>
name:Inside Cap's house
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Sunlight falls across Cap's modest front room. A folded note lies on the table beside his toolbox, while a wooden chair faces the window. An old telephone hangs on the wall. The room has the look of somewhere its owner expected to return to shortly.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
