dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
The narrow path follows a quiet stream beneath overhanging trees. Smooth stones lie along the bank, and dense bushes crowd a bend in the trail. Branches interlace above the undergrowth, hiding patches of sky behind their leaves.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
