<node>
name:Behind the nursery hedge
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Between the thick hedge and the stacked bulb baskets is a narrow, shaded space. Through gaps in the leaves, much of the loading yard is visible. The foliage offers good concealment, provided nobody makes too much noise.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
