dt=Text
<node>
hide
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
wait
4
ifobjin:truck,$available
	if:truck_seen
		msg:The men are finishing their conversation at the door. The hat and the crate leave you with little doubt: you need to find out where the truck is going.
		msg:Scoop points to the raised tarpaulin. "You can hide under there, Jerry. We'll wait for news at Cap's house."
	else
		set:truck_seen
		put:hat,hedge_watch
		msg:The nursery door opens. The driver and a second man emerge carrying a long wooden crate. The one walking backwards stops to catch his breath.
		msg:"Easy, this way," the driver mutters. Together they lift the crate onto the truck bed. As they tilt it, a hat slips out from under the lid.
		msg:Red grips your arm. "That's Cap's!"
		msg:The men push the crate under the tarpaulin, then return to the door to speak to Mrs Bulb. The hat lies beside the baskets, only a few steps from your hiding place.
		msg:The tarpaulin is raised on one side. Scoop points to it. "You could hide under there. If they're taking Cap away, we need to know where. We'll wait for your call at his house."
	endif
else
	if:villa_known
		msg:The loading yard is empty. The truck led you to the villa.
	else
		if:tracks_seen
			if:watch_started
				msg:The Striekers are making too much noise. Peg may have to move them before someone discovers your hiding place.
			else
				set:watch_started
				put:striekers,$here
				msg:You all crouch behind the baskets. Before you can see any movement in the nursery, the Striekers arrive. They speak loudly and threaten to expose your hiding place.
			endif
		else
			msg:Scoop lowers his voice. "First, let's find a reason to suspect the nursery. Those marks beside the entrance, perhaps..."
		endif
	endif
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
push
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
withobj:striekers
5
ifobjin:striekers,$available
	put:striekers,$nowhere
	put:truck,hedge_watch
	msg:Peg shoulders a heavy basket into the gap and advances on the Striekers. They back away, then turn and run. You all crouch behind the baskets again.
	msg:A little later, you hear an engine. A truck rolls slowly into the loading yard and stops beside the nursery door. The driver climbs out of the cab and knocks.
	msg:The door opens a crack. The man exchanges a few words with someone inside, then switches off the engine.
	msg:Scoop touches your arm. "Wait. Let's see what they've come to collect."
else
	msg:The Striekers are not here.
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
follow
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
withobj:truck
5
ifobjin:truck,$available
	if:truck_seen
		msg:The men turn to head back to the truck. "Jerry, now!" Scoop whispers.
		msg:You dash out of hiding as the driver climbs into the cab. The engine starts and the truck begins to move. You grab the tailboard, haul yourself onto the bed and slip beneath the tarpaulin unseen.
		msg:Through a fold in the canvas, you glimpse your friends leaving the yard. Scoop is taking them back to Cap's house to wait for your call.
		set:jerry_alone
		unset:withfriends
		put:truck,$nowhere
		put:crate,truck_bed
		put:peg,cap_interior
		put:red,cap_interior
		put:scoop,cap_interior
		waitkey
		goto:truck_bed
	else
		msg:Scoop catches your sleeve. "Wait. We don't know what they've come to collect yet. Let's watch."
	endif
else
	msg:You don't see the truck here.
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
run
4
ifobjin:truck,$available
	if:truck_seen
		msg:The men turn to head back to the truck. "Jerry, now!" Scoop whispers.
		msg:You dash out of hiding as the driver climbs into the cab. The engine starts and the truck begins to move. You grab the tailboard, haul yourself onto the bed and slip beneath the tarpaulin unseen.
		msg:Through a fold in the canvas, you glimpse your friends leaving the yard. Scoop is taking them back to Cap's house to wait for your call.
		set:jerry_alone
		unset:withfriends
		put:truck,$nowhere
		put:crate,truck_bed
		put:peg,cap_interior
		put:red,cap_interior
		put:scoop,cap_interior
		waitkey
		goto:truck_bed
	else
		msg:Scoop catches your sleeve. "Wait. We don't know what they've come to collect yet. Let's watch."
	endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
w
4
ifobjin:truck,$available
	if:truck_seen
		msg:The truck is about to leave with the crate. You can't abandon your only lead now.
	else
		msg:Scoop stops you. "Wait, Jerry. Let's see what they've come to collect."
	endif
else
	goto:nursery_front
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
talk
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
withobj:gang
5
if:withfriends
	if:money_found
		msg:Scoop: "Back to the nursery. That's where we need to look for Cap."
	else
		if:gang_reunited
			msg:Scoop: "Let's go back to the villa. We need to find out what those men are hiding."
		else
			if:truck_seen
				msg:Scoop: "Jerry, follow that truck! You can hide beneath the tarpaulin."
			else
				ifobjin:truck,$available
					msg:Scoop: "The truck has just arrived. Let's watch what they've come to collect."
				else
					if:watch_started
						msg:Scoop: "Those Striekers will give us away. Peg, can you get rid of them without too much noise?"
					else
						if:tracks_seen
							msg:Scoop: "Let's hide behind the baskets and watch the loading yard."
						else
							msg:Red: "First, let's check the marks beside the nursery entrance."
						endif
					endif
				endif
			endif
		endif
	endif
else
	msg:Your friends aren't here.
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
