msg:The truck slows outside a villa surrounded by a high wall. While the men get out to open the gate, you slip off the truck bed and hide behind a pillar.
msg:The truck enters the grounds. Before the gate closes, you glimpse the two men unloading the crate and dragging it along the side of the villa.
msg:Then the shrubs hide them from view.
