<node>
name:The villa gate
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
An iron gate stands between solid stone pillars, with a small brass nameplate fixed beside it. Beyond the bars, carefully tended shrubs partly conceal a handsome villa. The high boundary wall gives the property an air of privacy that seems almost unfriendly.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
