dt=Text
<node>
x
6
if:villa_men_gone
	msg:Now the men have gone, there's no need to peer over the wall. The gap beside the gate lets you into the garden.
else
	if:crate_buried
		msg:You know where they buried the crate. Now you just need to make sure the men leave.
	else
		if:gang_reunited
			msg:Peg cups his hands and braces himself against the wall. "A foot here, Jerry. I'll lift you. Red and Scoop can keep watch."
		else
			msg:The wall is too high and smooth to climb alone. If someone gave you a lift, you could reach the top and look into the garden. The others are waiting for news at Cap's house; there's a public telephone to the south.
		endif
	endif
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
climb
6
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
use
6
if:gang_reunited
	if:villa_men_gone
		msg:There's no need to climb now: the men have gone, and you can enter through the gap beside the gate.
	else
		if:crate_buried
			msg:You've seen where they buried the crate. Better stay hidden and wait for them to leave.
		else
			msg:Peg cups his hands and lifts you. You reach the top of the wall and peer just far enough over it to see, while Red and Scoop keep watch.
			msg:Beside the toolshed, the two men are finishing a hole. The crate lies next to them. "Nobody will look for it here," says the one in the cap.
			msg:They lower it into the hole and begin covering it with earth. Your stomach tightens: what if Cap really is inside?
			msg:Peg gives your shoe a gentle tug. "What's happening up there?" You slide back down and tell them what you've seen.
			msg:Scoop holds you back. "Wait. They have to leave first."
			set:crate_buried
			put:crate,$nowhere
		endif
	endif
else
	msg:You try to cling to the wall, but can't reach the top. You can't manage alone. You need your friends' help.
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
verb
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
wait
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
hide
4
if:villa_men_gone
	msg:The truck has gone. Peg points to a gap beside the gate: you can go in and check the crate.
else
	if:crate_buried
		msg:You stay hidden beside the gate. A little later the engine starts: the two men drive out in the truck and head down the road.
		msg:You wait until the sound fades. Peg points to a gap beside the gate. "Now."
		set:villa_men_gone
	else
		msg:From beyond the wall comes a metallic clink, followed by a rhythmic scraping in the earth. The shrubs hide the back garden: you can't see what the men are doing from the gate.
		if:gang_reunited
			msg:Peg looks at the top of the wall. "I can lift you. Take a look, but keep out of sight."
		else
			msg:You can't see over the wall on your own. You should contact your friends: the public telephone is south of here.
		endif
	endif
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
n
4
if:villa_men_gone
	goto:villa_garden
else
	if:crate_buried
		msg:The men are still in the grounds. Better stay hidden until they've driven away.
	else
		if:gang_reunited
			msg:You don't know where the men are. Before going in, you could ask Peg to help you look over the wall.
		else
			msg:It's not safe to enter alone. First, call your friends from the public telephone to the south.
		endif
	endif
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
talk
4
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
withobj:gang
5
if:gang_reunited
	if:money_found
		msg:Scoop: "Back to the nursery. That's where we need to look for Cap."
	else
		if:villa_men_gone
			msg:Peg: "The men have gone. Let's slip through the gap and enter the garden."
		else
			if:crate_buried
				msg:Scoop: "Now we know where the crate is, but the men are still inside. Let's wait for them to leave."
			else
				msg:Peg: "The wall's too high to see over from here. I can lift you: try climbing it."
			endif
		endif
	endif
else
	msg:The others are waiting for news. The truck went in here: go to the public telephone to the south and call them.
endif

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
