dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Soil dusts the surface of a heavy oak potting bench. Clay pots, bulb boxes and gardening supplies crowd a substantial wooden shelf, while several loose boards lean nearby. Daylight from a small side window leaves the corners of the room in shadow.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
