dt=Text
<node>
desc
3
Copper pipes twist between barrels and an illicit still, hidden behind the nursery's respectable trade. Bulb crates conceal bottles and account books. A plain wooden chair stands among the equipment, and the warm air carries a sharp, sour smell.

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
